# Store and check out every text file with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. booth-e2e copies
# this checkout onto a Linux droplet as raw files (ADR 0055), and a CRLF shell script or chart
# template must never reach it. Subsumes the previous narrower *.sh/docker/**/Dockerfile-only
# rules — every text file needs this, not just the ones known to break a Linux entrypoint.
* text=auto eol=lf
